GEPA (Genetic-Pareto) — attribution

This project reimplements the GEPA optimization algorithm in TypeScript,
guided by the published paper. This is an independent reimplementation, not
a port of the reference Python source. Module layout and adapter shapes are
intentionally different.

Paper / citation:

  Agrawal et al., 2025. GEPA: Reflective Prompt Evolution Can Outperform
  Reinforcement Learning. arXiv:2507.19457.
  Cite as: agrawal2025gepa
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.19457
  https://github.com/gepa-ai/gepa

